step Verification the JRU Emergency Brake Command is Empty
sub SubStep1
expect efs: FORALL X IN JRU.Messages | X.EMERGENCY_BRAKE_COMMAND_STATE == EMPTY @ deadline=1
step Emergency Brake Changes again
sub SubStep1
efs: Kernel.BrakeCommands.EmergencyBrakeCommands <- []
